guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":0.0681,"r5":0.0223,"r20":0.0489,"r1_spy":0.0615,"r5_spy":0.0235,"r20_spy":0.0475}}],"quotes":[{"c":"NTNX 2018 Q1","e":"ntnx","d":"2017-11-30","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Dheeraj Pandey","x":"Outside of the healthcare and federal verticals, a leading entertainment provider with 17 facilities, including casinos, hotels, and show theaters, uses our platform to support its value gaining management software.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2017/11/30/nutanix-inc-ntnx-q1-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"NTNX 2018 Q1","e":"ntnx","d":"2017-11-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Duston Williams","x":"The Q1 '18 gross margins benefited by approximately 1.5 percentage points as we purposely eliminated more than 9% of revenue attributable to our pass-through hardware revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2017/11/30/nutanix-inc-ntnx-q1-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"NTNX 2018 Q1","e":"ntnx","d":"2017-11-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Duston Williams","x":"First, we will begin the migration away from pass-through hardware-related revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2017/11/30/nutanix-inc-ntnx-q1-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"NTNX 2018 Q4","e":"ntnx","d":"2018-08-30","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Dheeraj Pandey","x":"While we've talked about how we'll be streaming our technology over the Internet of Xi, spelled X-I, we also have an immense opportunity to convert our on-prem software entitlements, which were typically termed over the life of the device, to explicit one, three, or five-year term licenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/30/nutanix-inc-ntnx-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"NTNX 2018 Q4","e":"ntnx","d":"2018-08-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Duston Williams","x":"In fiscal 2018, we embarked on a business and consumption model transition, the likes of which few if any companies have accomplished, focusing on the elimination of the pass-through hardware revenue associated with the sales of our turnkey NX Appliances.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/30/nutanix-inc-ntnx-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"NTNX 2018 Q4","e":"ntnx","d":"2018-08-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Duston Williams","x":"During our Q1 2018 earnings call just nine months ago, we committed to a bold plan to eliminate a majority of our pass-through hardware revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/30/nutanix-inc-ntnx-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"NTNX 2018 Q4","e":"ntnx","d":"2018-08-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dheeraj Pandey","x":"We have also continued to streamline our marketing efforts by getting more surgical in our targeting, by region, by product, by customer, and by leveraging our digital assets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/30/nutanix-inc-ntnx-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"NTNX 2019 Q2","e":"ntnx","d":"2019-02-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dheeraj Pandey","x":"The field operation was looking to streamline its IT infrastructure for production workloads and chose our software with an extremely competitive process.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/01/nutanix-inc-ntnx-q2-2019-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"NTNX 2019 Q4","e":"ntnx","d":"2019-08-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Rod Hall","x":"If you look at the -- if you back up the hardware pass through and you just look at the software margins in the quarter and the support margins, the software margin seem to dip quite a bit and then the support margins are up a lot, and I'm assuming maybe that is related to the success you've had…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/28/nutanix-inc-ntnx-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTNX 2020 Q1","e":"ntnx","d":"2019-11-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dheeraj Pandey","x":"They turned to us to reduce operating costs by significantly shrinking their database licensing fees and a great example for TCO, cost savings on these licenses alone funded their purchase of our software.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/26/nutanix-inc-ntnx-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTNX 2020 Q2","e":"ntnx","d":"2020-02-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Katy Huberty","x":"Have you seen renewals yet, such that you have confidence that you could raise prices as customers come up on the renewal?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/04/nutanix-inc-ntnx-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTNX 2020 Q3","e":"ntnx","d":"2020-05-27","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Dheeraj Pandey","x":"We believe that this trend of zero touch IT self-service delivery and streaming cloud-based infrastructure will hasten in the post-COVID world.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/27/nutanix-inc-ntnx-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTNX 2020 Q3","e":"ntnx","d":"2020-05-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dheeraj Pandey","x":"If carefully coordinated, these actions do minimize the impact on our customers and our employees, while prioritizing temporary measures such as furloughs instead of permanent changes such as layoffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/27/nutanix-inc-ntnx-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTNX 2020 Q3","e":"ntnx","d":"2020-05-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Duston Williams","x":"Major events such as.NEXT and our worldwide sales meetings will go virtual along with many other cost saving initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/27/nutanix-inc-ntnx-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTNX 2021 Q3","e":"ntnx","d":"2021-05-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Duston Williams","x":"Our operating expense guidance includes approximately $15 million in severance costs related to the previously mentioned limited workforce reductions that took place in Q4.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/26/nutanix-inc-ntnx-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTNX 2021 Q3","e":"ntnx","d":"2021-05-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rajiv Ramaswami","x":"It allows our customers to streamline holiday, install database as provision databases and then lifecycle of the databases and manage all the day-to-day operations that they need to do on their databases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/26/nutanix-inc-ntnx-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTNX 2021 Q4","e":"ntnx","d":"2021-09-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rajiv Ramaswami","x":"We laid out a roadmap for our solutions strategy and how we are streamlining our portfolio, focusing on fewer bigger bets in the areas of database-as-a-service, unified storage and desktop-as-a-service.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/09/02/nutanix-inc-ntnx-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTNX 2021 Q4","e":"ntnx","d":"2021-09-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Duston Williams","x":"Our Q4 expenses included approximately $12 million in severance expense related to a previously disclosed sales and marketing headcount reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/09/02/nutanix-inc-ntnx-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTNX 2025 Q4","e":"ntnx","d":"2025-08-27","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Ruplu Bhattacharya","x":"Can you help us segment that into how much of that is from tariffs?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/27/nutanix-ntnx-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTNX 2025 Q4","e":"ntnx","d":"2025-08-27","l":"pric